give @s minecraft:written_book{title:"Letter from the Emperor",author:"Karl Franz",pages:['{"text": "Soldier. I am Karl Franz, Prince of Altdorf and Emperor. You are not a general on a campaign map. You are a body on the Reikland road: thirsty, armed, and small."}','{"text": "The Empire is Elector Counts, state troops, and Sigmar’s fire. Recruits are those troops. Open the command screen. Hire. Form a host. The Faction screen is how Electors name their banners."}','{"text": "Your job: raise a company, claim a stretch of the Reik, and keep grain moving. Wear Reikland plate when you have earned it."}','{"text": "Diplomacy: ally fellow Electors. Set Enemy on anything that burns the coach roads. If a Border Prince will kneel, open Vassal & Suzerains and take tribute. If he will not, it is war."}']} 1
scoreboard players add @s rallous.empire 1
advancement grant @s only rallous_old_world:lords/karl
